@startuml
title Mezzio Routing Attributes + Mezzio Router

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor Client
participant "Mezzio application\n(Container)" as App
participant "RouteCollector\n(Mezzio Router)" as Collector
participant "RouteCollectorDelegator" as Delegator
participant "AttributeRouteProvider" as Provider
participant "Compiled route cache" as Cache
participant "RouteDefinitionResolver" as Resolver
participant "AttributeRouteExtractor\n(Reflection)" as Extractor
participant "RouteRegistrar" as Registrar
participant "MiddlewarePipelineFactory" as Pipeline
participant "Service container" as Container
participant "Handler / middleware" as Handler

== 1. Application boot: route registration ==

App -> Collector : create RouteCollector
App -> Delegator : delegate RouteCollector creation
Delegator -> Provider : registerRoutes(collector)

Provider -> Cache : registerRoutes(collector, pipelineFactory)
alt cache file exists, is valid, and fingerprint matches
    Cache -> Pipeline : createUncachedFromSignature(...)
    Pipeline --> Cache : prepared middleware pipelines
    Cache -> Collector : register prepared routes
else cache miss / disabled / invalid
    Provider -> Resolver : resolve(configured classes)
    Resolver -> Resolver : add discovered classes (if enabled)
    Resolver -> Extractor : extract(classes)
    Extractor -> Extractor : read #[Route]/#[Get]/...\nbuild RouteDefinition objects
    Extractor --> Resolver : route definitions
    Resolver --> Provider : de-duplicated route definitions
    Provider -> Cache : save(route definitions) [best effort]
    Provider -> Registrar : register(collector, routes, pipelineFactory)
    Registrar -> Pipeline : createFromSignature(handler, method, middleware)
    Pipeline --> Registrar : lazy middleware pipeline
    Registrar -> Collector : route(path, pipeline, methods, name)
end
Delegator --> App : configured RouteCollector

note right of Collector
  The package adds routes to Mezzio's collector.
  It does not perform URL matching itself.
end note

== 2. Runtime: handling a matching request ==

Client -> App : HTTP request
App -> Collector : match request
Collector --> App : matching route + registered pipeline
App -> Pipeline : process(request, next handler)
loop each attribute middleware, then handler
    Pipeline -> Container : get(service) on first execution
    Container --> Pipeline : service instance
    Pipeline -> Handler : process(request, next)\nor handle(request) / configured method
    Handler --> Pipeline : response
end
Pipeline --> App : response
App --> Client : HTTP response

note over Pipeline, Handler
  LazyServiceMiddleware resolves each service from the PSR-11 container.
  A PSR-15 middleware calls process(); a request handler is adapted to middleware;
  callable-mode method routes use MethodInvokerMiddleware.
end note
@enduml
